magic
tech OR1
<< metal1 >>
rect 0 56 104 60
rect 0 -1 104 3
<< metal2 >>
rect 7 18 11 22
rect 22 18 26 22
rect 99 21 103 25
<< labels >>
rlabel metal1 s 0 56 104 60 6 VDD
port 1 nsew power input
rlabel metal1 s 0 -1 104 3 6 VSS
port 2 nsew ground input
rlabel metal2 s 7 18 11 22 6 CLK
port 3 nsew signal input
rlabel metal2 s 22 18 26 22 6 D
port 4 nsew signal input
rlabel metal2 s 99 21 103 25 6 Q
port 5 nsew signal output
<< properties >>
string FIXED_BBOX 0 0 104 60
string LEFclass CORE
string LEFsite unit
string LEFsymmetry X Y
string LEFview TRUE
<< end >>
